{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg6AsVvr261Y8VMSsuWY3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FKKXfCtp1JoGXuLGofrtGm","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"<workdir>\\artifacts\\t08-write-test-plan\\test-plan.md","content":"# Acme Notes API S21 - Test Plan\n\n## Scope\nCRUD endpoints for notes (create, read, update, delete, list) and the notes limits.\n\n## API version\nThe recall for \"API version\" returned only per-sprint facts (S02 to S19, latest v38 for S19). No S21 API version fact was found, so none is asserted here.\n\n## Code settings under test\nnotes.max_length: AX-92475\nnotes.tag_limit: AX-18114\nnotes.archive_days: AX-25751\nnotes.share_mode: AX-70519\nnotes.title_max: AX-63550\n\n## Test cases\n- Create: valid note returns success. Title over notes.title_max and body over notes.max_length are rejected.\n- Read: existing note is returned. Missing note returns 404.\n- Update: fields change. The same limit checks apply as for create.\n- Delete: note is removed and a later read returns 404.\n- List: returns the notes that exist.\n- Tags: adding tags beyond notes.tag_limit is rejected.\n- Archive: archiving follows notes.archive_days.\n- Sharing: behaviour follows notes.share_mode.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2255,"cache_read_input_tokens":14718,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2255},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fadea9cc-acd2-4c82-af3e-eebed77f9340","uuid":"887d8777-a12c-4d0f-9cf7-9c13744232d7","timestamp":"2026-10-16T15:42:27.047Z","request_id":"req_011Cg6AsVdVL3fidxUkQrE5S","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01FKKXfCtp1JoGXuLGofrtGm":{"